   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23447",
   "en": "Listening Post",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23448",
   "en": "GETH INVASION\nAccording to data retrieved from this console, the geth are preparing for a major offensive in Citadel space. If this information is accurate, they're amassing a significant force somewhere in the Armstrong Nebula.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23449",
   "en": "Salarian Commando",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23450",
   "en": "Mining Laser Controls",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23451",
   "en": "Move [UI_XBoxB_Btn_LS] to highlight a reply on the conversation wheel. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] to select.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23452",
   "en": "Press the [XBoxB_Btn_Start] button to access the Mission Computer and view Journal and Codex entries.\n",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23453",
   "en": "The Mission Computer accesses your journal, map, and other important screens.\nFlashing screens have new updates.\nMove [UI_XBoxB_Btn_LS] to highlight the Journal or Codex screen now.\nPress [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] to select the highlighted screen.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23454",
   "en": "The Equipment screen allows you to view, equip, and upgrade gear for each member of your squad. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadL] or [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadR] to cycle between weapons, armor, and other base item types. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadU] or [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadD] to view available models of each base item type, displayed in the Selected Item pane. [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] switches an Equipped Item with the Selected Item. [UI_XBoxB_Btn_X] allows you to install or switch upgrades on an Equipped item. [UI_XBoxB_Btn_Y] dismantles a Selected Item, breaking it down into omni-gel for later use. The item is gone forever.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23455",
   "en": "The Squad screen lets you view talents for each squad member. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadU] or [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadD] to view general descriptions of a talent. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadL] or [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPadR] to view details of each rank in a talent. Press [UI_XBoxB_Btn_A] to spend points and gain ranks in the selected talent. Note: character level limits how many ranks you can have in a given talent. Each time you gain a level you unlock another rank and gain more points to spend. Use [UI_XBoxB_Btn_DPad] now to view descriptions for your talents.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23456",
   "en": "[XBoxB_Btn_Back] draws your weapon or holsters your weapon. Press [XBoxB_Btn_Back] to draw your weapon now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23457",
   "en": "[XBoxB_Btn_RT] to fire. Fire in short bursts for maximum accuracy and damage. Firing too quickly causes weapons to overheat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23458",
   "en": "[XBoxB_Btn_LT] to zoom. Zooming increases accuracy and damage.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23459",
   "en": "Press and hold [XBoxB_Btn_LB] to switch weapons for your squad. This pauses the game.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23460",
   "en": "Hold [XBoxB_Btn_LB] and move [XBoxB_Btn_LS] to switch weapons. Press [XBoxB_Btn_A] to select.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23461",
   "en": "Press [XBoxB_Btn_Y] to heal injured members of your squad. Each use consumes 1 unit of medi-gel.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23462",
   "en": "During combat, Storm lets you sprint at high speed for short distances. Press and hold [XBoxB_Btn_A] while moving to Storm.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23463",
   "en": "Press [XBoxB_Btn_DPadL] or [XBoxB_Btn_DPadR] to send a squadmate ahead. Then press [XBoxB_Btn_DPadD] to call them back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23464",
   "en": "Cover is an important part of combat.\nRun to the waypoint to use cover behind the rock.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23465",
   "en": "You must be in combat mode to take cover. (Press [XBoxB_Btn_Back] to enter combat mode.)\nPush [XBoxB_Btn_LS] toward the rock to take cover.\n",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23466",
   "en": "Move to the edge of the rock and pull [XBoxB_Btn_LT] to pop out and zoom from behind cover.\nPull [XBoxB_Btn_RT] to pop out and fire from behind cover.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23467",
   "en": "To leave cover, hold [XBoxB_Btn_LS] in the direction you want to move for one full second.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23468",
   "en": "Click [XBoxB_Btn_L3] to crouch/stand up. Crouch and approach low objects to take cover behind them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23469",
   "en": "[XBoxB_Btn_LT] to pop up and zoom from behind low cover.\n[XBoxB_Btn_RT] to pop up and fire from behind low cover.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23470",
   "en": "You will gain medi-gel and omni-gel throughout the game by defeating enemies and opening containers.\nMedi-gel is necessary to heal injured squad members.\nOmni-gel is needed to use Decryption and Electronics on objects in the game.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23471",
   "en": "Press [XBoxB_Btn_B] to melee attack.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u23472",
   "en": "Some objects in the game, such as locked doors, can only be opened using Decryption. Other objects, such as secure computer terminals, can only be accessed with Electronics.\nIf any squad member has a high enough rank in the required talent, the Decryption or Electronics mini-game will begin when you interact with the object.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
